One decision worth noting: a key whose name matches a sensitive term (like `authorization`) is fully redacted, so its `'Bearer xxx'` value becomes `'[redacted]'` rather than `'Bearer [redacted]'`. That matches the spec (key-name redaction takes precedence over string redaction since the value never reaches the string path).

